Just pushed up an initial implementation of latex output support as its own branch.

Having never used knitr with .Rnw documents I must say I'm stunned at the difference
between the difference of the original markdown knitted document rendered as pdf via
pandoc (rmarkdown v2) and the knitted output of this direct to latex document! It makes
